{"font":"minecraft:default","color":"light_purple","bold":false,"text":"並將對應素材的代償給封於紙中。"},
{"font":"minecraft:default","color":"blue","bold":false,"text":"可代償素材是這些。","hoverEvent":{"action":"show_text","contents":[
{"text":"盤穴洞根：扣6點生命，冷卻-60秒。","color":"white","bold":"true"},"\\n"
,{"text":"命脈肉排：扣5點魔攻30秒，冷卻-40秒。","color":"white","bold":"true"},"\\n"
,{"text":"氓騰山果：詠唱速度減少10% 30秒，冷卻-20秒。","color":"white","bold":"true"},"\\n"
,{"text":"魔泥汙骨：魔力消費增加10% 30秒，冷卻-20秒。","color":"white","bold":"true"},"\\n"
,{"text":"銀狼毛皮：移動速度下降10% 30秒，冷卻-20秒。","color":"white","bold":"true"},"\\n"
,{"text":"秘銀錠：盔甲下降2點30秒，冷卻-20秒。","color":"white","bold":"true"},"\\n"
]}},"\\n",
""]'
